On **.NET 10 SDK**, you **no longer need `TestingPlatformDotnetTestSupport`**. That property is only for .NET 9 and earlier where `dotnet test` still used the VSTest mode by default.

Instead, add a `"test"` section to your `global.json`:

```json
{
  "sdk": {
    "version": "10.0.100"
  },
  "test": {
    "runner": "Microsoft.Testing.Platform"
  }
}
```

Then remove `<TestingPlatformDotnetTestSupport>` from your project file — it's redundant.

